      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَارِبَةٌ</span></b>  [a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَارِبٌ</span>, made such by the
affix <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>,] <i>A people,</i> or <i>party, dwelling upon the
side</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَفَّة</span>, in some copies of the K <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُفَّة</span>,) <i>of a
